# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
# Lumen OS X50 Ultra (g0111) images (image path /system/etc/init/x50_blobs.rc; script
# /system/etc/z9x/x50_blobs.sh 0755, allow-list /system/etc/z9x/x50_blobs_allow.txt 0644, plus the 0-byte
# placeholders listed there). Fork of tools/ota/image/z9x_blobs.rc for the X50 reader (devices/g0111/forks.tsv).
# exec at post-fs-data: after init.rc's part of the trigger (default mount namespace, APEXes active) and before the
# vendor's part (system rc files are parsed first, so xgimi_middle is not started yet in this boot), so the binds
# are seen by every later service; the Codec2 / media services, the vendor audio HAL and the eye-protection drawer
# nativeui (x50_nui.rc) start only after it returns.
# Cost: well under a second, <= 32 MiB tmpfs while it runs (about 9 MB kept).
on post-fs-data
    exec u:r:su:s0 root root -- /system/bin/sh /system/etc/z9x/x50_blobs.sh
